  "contract": "The First-Class Experimental Teleporter (gameobject 323232, gossip text 61004) offers, in one menu, the character's own faction capitals, Booty Bay and the endgame zones Burning Steppes, Western Plaguelands, Silithus, Un'Goro Crater and Winterspring (user list 2026-10-08, Eastern Plaguelands removed by the user). Every jump costs 8 gold (user choice 2026-10-08) and is refused without the money, charging nothing. A jump starts 985513 'Experimental Teleporter', a 5 minute recharge during which the teleporter refuses with a notice. A city jump lands at the city's teleport point; a zone jump drops the character 120 yards above the zone's teleport point with Parachute 45472, applied after arrival when the jump crosses continents. The first jump completes Path to Ascension tutorial 31 and its achievement 87230.",
